## 11. Updated Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 0 — Backtest Audit Gate (Hard Blocking)

> **No model proceeds to live paper trading without passing the 7-step Phase 0 protocol.** This gate is unconditional.

**7-Step Phase 0 Protocol:**

```
Step 1 — DATA INTEGRITY AUDIT
  ✓ Verify no forward-looking features in feature set
  ✓ Confirm OHLCV data sources and adjustment methodology
  ✓ Check for survivorship bias in universe selection
  ✓ Validate no data leakage between train/test splits

Step 2 — REGIME COVERAGE AUDIT
  ✓ Ensure training data covers all 4 regimes
  ✓ Ensure test set includes TRENDING_DOWN periods
  ✓ Minimum 252 trading days per regime in training set

Step 3 — WALK-FORWARD VALIDATION
  ✓ Minimum 3 out-of-sample windows
  ✓ Each window: 90 days minimum
  ✓ No parameter refitting between windows

Step 4 — PERFORMANCE GATE METRICS
  ✓ Win Rate >= 60% on out-of-sample combined
  ✓ Sharpe Ratio >= 1.0 on out-of-sample
  ✓ Max Drawdown <= 20% in any test window
  ✓ Profit Factor >= 1.3

Step 5 — TREND_DOWN REMEDIATION CHECK
  ✓ Measure win rate in TRENDING_DOWN regime specifically
  ✓ If TRENDING_DOWN win rate < 50%: apply SHORT-side penalty flag
  ✓ Document regime-conditional performance table

Step 6 — RSI ABLATION TEST
  ✓ Run model with RSI features removed
  ✓ Performance must not degrade >5% — confirms RSI not load-bearing
  ✓ Block any model where RSI is single-feature driver

Step 7 — DETERMINISTIC SAFETY LAYER TEST
  ✓ Inject synthetic edge cases: gaps, halts, earnings days, zero volume
  ✓ Confirm all hard filters trigger correctly
  ✓ Confirm state-lock prevents duplicate orders
  ✓ Sign off: human review of audit log
```

---

